poshli (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Install the generated single-file bundle as /usr/share/poshli/poshli.sh.
  * Run the upstream test suite against both sources and bundle during the
    build.
  * Package the library under LGPL-3.0-only; the embedded Unicode 15.0.0
    case-mapping data is distributed under Unicode-DFS-2016.

